{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34403","headline":"奉和袭美怀华阳润卿博士三首 三 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美怀华阳润卿博士三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"终日焚香礼洞云，更思琪树转劳神。\n曾寻下泊常经月，不到中峰又累春。\n仙道最高黄玉籙，暑天偏称白纶巾。\n清斋若见茅司命，乞取朱儿十二斤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34403.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34403","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}